<title>UK: Powergen completes buyback at 605p each.</title>
<headline>Powergen completes buyback at 605p each.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British electricity generator PowerGen Plc said on Thursday that an operation to repurchase about 33.5 million of its shares had been completed during the morning at a price of 605 pence each.</p>
<p>The buyback, carried out by UBS Limited and Kleinwort Benson Securities Limited as agents, had mopped up about 5.0 percent of its current issued shares and stemmed from a decision last month to buy back up to 10 percent of its shares &quot;when appropriate.&quot; -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
